["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"黄仁勋x张忠谋：一生有你——英伟达和台积电的激荡30年 COWOS 流片 良率 无厂芯片公司 硅光\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-cnf65bb3-黄仁勋两次拒绝当台积电ceo-我已有工作/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3a0730bdeb939094-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">科技这碗饭</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋两次拒绝当台积电CEO：我已有工作</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张忠谋2013年认真考虑把创办26年的台积电交给黄仁勋，黄仁勋只回了五个字「我已有工作」，两次都是这一句。当年台积电市值是英伟达的10倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体</span><span class=\"tag\">台积电</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"698. The Troubles: The Brink of Civil War (Part 2) RUC UVF NICRA B Specials\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-restishistory-英国的一无所知与强硬派的纵火把北爱推向内战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>英国对北爱一无所知，强硬派纵火把爱尔兰拖向内战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">北爱冲突不是简单的教派仇恨，而是英国的信息真空、保皇派的蓄意纵火和民权运动的真实冤情互相放大，一起把爱尔兰拖向内战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北爱冲突</span><span class=\"tag\">民权运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.271 阿迪达斯如何触底反弹？ Samba 可销售月数 减计准备 破二\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-bizthisway-阿迪达斯触底反弹-炒冷饭比巨星联名更稳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">28:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商业就是这样</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>阿迪达斯触底反弹：炒冷饭比巨星联名更稳</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿迪达斯从2021年高点接近腰斩后，靠解冻复古鞋、修复经销商和严格控库存完成业绩复苏，但股价反弹又回落，揭示运动品牌周期的本质是库存与预期的博弈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿迪达斯</span><span class=\"tag\">运动品牌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Searching For A Co-Founder Is How You Get A Bad One | 4 VC-Backed Solo Founders leaky bucket smile curve SFP ODF\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-solofounders-找联合创始人这件事-越刻意越容易找错人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6b9626cb5db9929c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>找联合创始人这件事，越刻意越容易找错人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把联合创始人当成创业的前提条件，最后往往只能凑一个「便利联合创始人」；四位单人创始人用亲身经历说明，先独自跑起来，对的人会在路上出现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">联合创始人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From Chrome DevTools to AI Engineering, with Addy Osmani cognitive surrender alpha unbundling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-pragmatic-ai-时代工程师的护城河是品味与问责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8706fd7ea4b30623-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让写代码贬值，工程师的护城河是品味与问责</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chrome DevTools 负责人 Addy Osmani 认为，AI 让写代码贬值，工程师的真正优势是品味与问责；要警惕认知投降，把 AI 的答案当成自己的答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Chrome DevTools</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Alien Companion App That&#x27;s Bringing In $4M a Year (Best of the Pod) judge prompt lower seeds situations daemon\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-aiandi-ai-伴侣不做预设-记忆即角色-年入-400-万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/979c8913b42df2b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 伴侣年入 400 万美元：不做预设剧情，靠记忆即兴发挥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 伴侣 Portola 的 Tolon 抛弃预设剧情和角色表，用记忆当角色表、把生成当即兴，做到年化收入 400 万美元。这套「即兴演员」方法论和混合模型策略，是 ChatGPT 之外的另一条产品路径。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI伴侣</span><span class=\"tag\">即兴叙事</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"$4M in 4 Weeks: How This AI Alien Companion App Took Off (Best of the Pod) Big Five vibe prompting judge prompt character-driven computing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-every-4周破400万美元-ai伴侣的爆红与500ms陷阱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85a2a5e14cec9857-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Every</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI伴侣4周赚400万美元：多500毫秒延迟就崩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI外星伴侣 Tolen 四周内 ARR 从 1 万美元飙到 400 万美元，但多 500 毫秒延迟所有指标就暴跌。增长靠病毒视频，留存靠把 AI 当叙事媒介而非工具。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI陪伴</span><span class=\"tag\">病毒增长</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Dr. Suchi Saria on Building AI That Changes Care failure to rescue DRG NTAP AI-based interventional protocols\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-nejmaigrandrou-ai-进医院最难的从来不是模型-是让医院算得清账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff7071d8628d0546-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">59:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NEJM AI Grand Rounds</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 进医院最难的从来不是模型，是让医院算得清账</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Suchi Saria 带着 90% 医生采用的脓毒症预警进入医院后断言：AI 的拦路虎不是模型性能，而是按病种付费制度下的信任与财务账。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗AI</span><span class=\"tag\">脓毒症预警</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Adam Weishaupt and the Bavarian Illuminati Illuminati Minerval Covenant of Perfectibility Astroturfing Principia Discordia Illuminatus! Trilogy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-stuffmissed-光照派从未统治世界-它连自己都管不好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>光照派死于内斗：阴谋论是后来编的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光照派是1776年教授与五名学生建立的反教会组织，巅峰约两三千人；它死于内斗和自恋，如今的阴谋论形象来自后来的书和恶作剧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">秘密结社</span><span class=\"tag\">阴谋论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Luke Burgis on Mimetic Desire, Catholicism, and the Age of Social Contagion mimetic desire scapegoat mechanism achievement subject sprezzatura via negativa memento mori\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-tyler-ai-削弱社会传染-反主流也是模仿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d05a7ce2e284a200-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>反主流也是模仿：AI 反而会削弱社会传染</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在传染时代，逃离不是解药；Burges 押注 AI 反而会削弱社会传染，并借天主教与 Cluny 的经验提出：真正该做的是重建中间机构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模仿理论</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 伦理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How Whatnot Built a Global Marketplace live commerce rules engine EBITDA margin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-a16z-直播电商在中国占三四成-美国还是个位数/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>直播电商在中国占三四成，美国还是个位数</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Whatnot 从卖宝可梦卡起步，靠用户自己在视频里卖货长成 80 亿美元年销售额的平台。中国直播电商已占全部电商三四成，美国还是个位数——这个差距会关掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">直播电商</span><span class=\"tag\">marketplace</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"【重听】朱雀三号副总师：火箭回收只有成与败，没有中间态| S9E41\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-whatsnext-入轨一分回收零分-火箭回收没有中间态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>入轨一分回收零分，火箭回收没有中间态</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱雀三号首飞入轨成功但回收失败，副总师董凯认为火箭发射只有成败没有中间态：入轨打一分，回收打零分。真正决定追赶速度的是回收场射程、发动机冗余和每年百台的产能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商业航天</span><span class=\"tag\">火箭回收</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"North Korea&#x27;s Messiah Presbyterian YMCA Jonestown cult\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-chinatalk-朝鲜不是民族国家-是一个宗教社会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e77c5ae8dd56873-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>朝鲜不是民族国家，是一个宗教社会</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金日成不是斯大林主义者，而是被19世纪美国福音派泡大的第三代基督徒；他偷听到农民相信他能水上行走后，决定照着传说演下去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">朝鲜</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"GPT-5.6 Sol Ultrafast.... Just Got UltraFaster (Cerebras 4th Gen) Wafer Scale Engine (WSE) Cross-reticle stitching Backpack Prefill/Decode Parametric yield\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-techtechpotato-推理速度才是新护城河-cerebras-机架化再提速/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fbc2fddc567e0b62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>Cerebras 单芯片 4400 tok/s：推理速度才是护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cerebras 的 WSE 3.5 把单芯片速度推到 4400 tok/s，CS4 机架把三片晶圆塞进 120kW 机柜。核心理由：推理要拆成 prefill 和 decode，速度才是护城河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">Cerebras</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Canada&#x27;s controversial resettlement programme outport growth centre Confederation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-witness-加拿大三万人大搬迁-最好的事与最糟的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">9:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>加拿大三万人搬迁：年轻人得救，老人失去一切</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1954 年起，加拿大纽芬兰近三万人从偏远渔村迁往城镇。年轻一代获得教育与出路，老人和因纽特人却失去家园，失散到再无联系方式。搬迁没有统一答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城镇化</span><span class=\"tag\">移民安置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Clown Car W/ Gamersnexus ACR (Automated Content Recognition) SPV (Special Purpose Vehicle) Opex\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-betteroffline-ai-巨头财报像-enron-英伟达背书的算力泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头财报像 Enron：英伟达背书的算力泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 公司高管不再谈技术，只谈钱和吉瓦。英伟达用投资和担保撑起客户收入，像 Enron 一样玩财务工程，但还没到违法那一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"151. 17岁被2026年ICML收录论文的小少年：我bet开心！开心！开心！ Attention Projection Mixing with Exogenous Anchors Value Residual Learning fineweb edu UBI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-zhangxiaojun-17岁ai原住民-学数学的理由-变成了向大学证明能吃苦/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/510756c6bdaa8239-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>17岁AI原住民：学数学的理由，变成了向大学证明能吃苦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 出现后，他学数学的理由退化成向大学证明自己能吃苦：原来能看到的大学、读博、推进数学那条路变窄了，身边想做航天的同学也在失去向上的动力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI原住民</span><span class=\"tag\">AI与教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Do You Defend Against AI That Can Hack? guardrails honeypot script kiddies signature-based detection\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-a16z-ai-攻击面是全部人类表达-签名检测已死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">22:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>AI 攻击面是全部人类表达，签名检测已死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安全工具过去只防两样东西：人和恶意软件。AI 智能体两样都不是，行为基线的前提——软件行为可预测——已经失效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Make Better Decisions by Fixing Yourself First CGM Robux MCP Lua\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-knowledge-先修代谢再谈决策-roblox-创始人反常识管理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e77873607703d33-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>生酮逆转儿子双相后，Roblox 创始人把决策拆成四层</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">David Baszucki 把 Roblox 的决策操作系统拆成四层：身体代谢状态决定重大判断，长期视角乘以快速迭代，通用系统优于硬编码，以及旧模式失效时直接换一整套新经济系统。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">决策</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Child custody through divorce: Navigating the courts and building a custody schedule that works with Michael Fried OurFamilyWizard collaborative law parent coordinator change of circumstances forensic psychologist best interest of the child\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-secureattach-法院已默认五五开-赢家心态才是真正的输/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">52:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>离婚监护权：法院已默认五五开，赢家心态才是真输家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">纽约离婚律师用十年趋势告诉你：法院已从「证明单方监护」转向「为什么不是五五开」；真正决定孩子好坏的，不是时间表，而是父母能否把孩子需求放在自己的痛苦前面。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">离婚</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童监护</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"493 追忆历史学家亚当·麦基翁：华人移民与现代边境制度的形成 indentured labor Natal model 加拿大原则\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-cn2aa250-华人劳工塑造了美国海关-现代边控源自排华法案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>华人劳工塑造了美国海关：现代边控源自排华法案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">海关、签证与护照制度并非欧美内生的发明，而是19世纪末华人移民涌入美国后，为甄别与排斥而催生。合法移民艰难、非法移民容易的吊诡，到今天仍在延续。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麦基翁</span><span class=\"tag\">移民史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ben Thompson on Big Tech, China, and the AI Boom Running Out of Money - [Invest Like the Best, EP.487] reluctant accelerationist NeoCloud hyperscaler token efficiency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-ilt-美国赢下-ai-竞赛反而更危险-中国的最优解是炸掉-tsmc/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/95cf973ef8d0bef7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>美国赢下 AI 竞赛反而更危险：中国的最优解是炸掉 TSMC</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果美国在 AI 上取得压倒性优势，中国的博弈论最优解是炸掉 TSMC。硅谷不愿承认美国对中国供应链的依赖被严重低估，而这种依赖不会在冲突之外被修复。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"285: ENCORE: How Do I Help My Kid Develop a Work Ethic? work ethic intrinsic vs extrinsic motivation warmth and structure complain but comply purpose nagging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-asklisa-孩子不爱干活不用治-结构与后果比热爱更有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>孩子不爱干活不用治：结构与后果比热爱更有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">培养 work ethic 不靠让孩子爱干活，靠三件事：家庭结构有规则、特权与责任挂钩、让他感觉有人指望他；必要时让他在学校自己摔一跤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The battle of Mandalay in WW2 Fort Dufferin 19th Indian Division Frontier Force Regiment 14th Army\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-witness-曼德勒战役胜负手-放弃正面突击改用围困/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>曼德勒战役胜负手：放弃正面突击改用围困</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1945年3月英军攻打缅甸曼德勒，面对Fort Dufferin的厚墙深壕，正面强攻失败；师长拒绝硬攻，改为围困，最终日军弃城。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">二战</span><span class=\"tag\">缅甸</span>\n</div></div></a>"]